From: iAmMichaelConnor <mike@aztec.foundation>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 21:05:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add RangeChecked and a prechecked quadratic expression

`RangeChecked<T>` wraps a BigNum whose limbs are constrained to their range.
`evaluate_quadratic_expression_prechecked` takes only such values and omits the
per-call input range checks of `evaluate_quadratic_expression`; the quotient,
carry and relation checks are unchanged.

Local to zcash-storage-proofs (patches/bignum-prechecked.patch); not proposed
upstream.
